					"content": "#{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BIGBROTHER|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_BIGSISTER]}，你拿到香膏了吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						225000602
					],
					"speakerTitle": "璐璐"
				},
				{
					"id": 225000602,
					"content": "拿到了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						225000603
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 225000603,
					"content": "#谢谢{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BIGBROTHER|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_BIGSISTER]}，莺儿姐姐做的香膏可真好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						225000604
					],
					"speakerTitle": "璐璐"
				},
				{
					"id": 225000604,
					"content": "不知道小蒙和阿飞闻到了之后会是什么反应…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						225000605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "璐璐"
				},
				{
					"id": 225000605,
					"content": "不过，不管他们是什么反应，应该都很好玩吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						225000606,
						225000608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "璐璐"
				},
				{
					"id": 225000606,
					"content": "他们会喜欢的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						225000607
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 225000607,
					"content": "这样就最好啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						225000610
					],
					"speakerTitle": "璐璐"
				},
				{
					"id": 225000610,
					"content": "#谢谢{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BIGBROTHER|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_BIGSISTER]}，我等会就回家试试看这盒香膏。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						225000611
					],
					"speakerTitle": "璐璐"
				},
				{
					"id": 225000611,
					"content": "如果合适的话，那我就可以一直用下去啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "璐璐"
				},
				{
					"id": 225000608,
					"content": "你最喜欢和谁玩？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						225000609
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 225000609,
					"content": "唔？没有「最喜欢」喔，小蒙和阿飞，都是我最好的朋友。",
